	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_DL01M_TRMSG_FIGHT_PLAYER_LOSE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>その　ポケモンなら　しってるよ
めずらしいのが　みたかったなぁ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-02-13T07:05:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-20T05:41:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>その　ポケモンなら　知ってるよ
珍しいのが　みたかったなぁ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2012-02-13T07:05:11" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-08-08T05:39:08" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・ダウンロードキャラ用テンプレ１
・対戦後　プレイヤー負けメッセージ</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-20T05:41:11" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ダウンロードキャラ１
♂
小人１</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-20T07:24:05" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
