♂
中人１</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-20T07:24:59" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>226</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-20T07:05:49" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_DL04M_TRMSG_OPENING_ANNOUNCE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おおきな　かんせいを　うけて
いつもの　アイツの　にゅうじょうだ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-28T08:58:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-20T07:05:49" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ひときわ　大きな　歓声を受けて
