				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-15T03:27:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-20T07:29:05" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>頂点に　立てるのは　ひとり！
それは……　きみ　じゃない！▼
世界一の　ポケモンを　持つ
ぼくなんだ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-15T03:27:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="suginaka_katsunori:W00227"
				Time="2011-07-20T07:29:05" />
