				Time="2011-07-20T07:34:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>どちらか　強い方が　勝つ……
ただ　それだけのことだ！　行くぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-08-08T05:08:41" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
