				Time="2011-07-20T07:34:41" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>考えずに　突き進め！
おまえなら　どこまでも　行ける！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-07-27T09:24:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
