	<TextRow
		Label="TRID_WCS04W_TRMSG_OPENING_ANNOUNCE"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>どこまでも　かのじょは　つよくなる！
ヘイッ！　げんかいを　こえろ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="swan_scenario:W00293"
				Time="2011-09-26T10:39:39" />
